{"3118910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Reality Breach", "steam_appid": 3118910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/a3c050a1782f6c30152a791a61483278.poster.avif?t=1787573376\" width=1020 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/a3c050a1782f6c30152a791a61483278.webm?t=1787573376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/a3c050a1782f6c30152a791a61483278.mp4?t=1787573376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You quit your job, moved back to your home country, and isolated yourself for one dream: becoming a game developer. But dreams demand sacrifice, Theo… more than you ever imagined. Your own creation has turned against you, and now it wants to end it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality Breach is an immersive, first-person psychological horror game set inside the claustrophobic walls of an indie developer's home studio. To survive the night, you must confront an entity born from your own corrupted project, where the line between your game engine and your physical room completely shatters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/96b66a25370dc514426790ce2b2d3ad5.poster.avif?t=1787573376\" width=1020 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/96b66a25370dc514426790ce2b2d3ad5.webm?t=1787573376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/96b66a25370dc514426790ce2b2d3ad5.mp4?t=1787573376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive Your Own Code</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It doesn’t like you, Theo. The entity born from your project hunts you in your own house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide or Run:</strong> When the system breaches, find immediate cover or outmaneuver it to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/7d1c8e4bebba425d68fa2354de773358.poster.avif?t=1787573376\" width=1020 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/7d1c8e4bebba425d68fa2354de773358.webm?t=1787573376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/7d1c8e4bebba425d68fa2354de773358.mp4?t=1787573376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Insanity or Reality?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you losing your mind, Theo? Don’t let it consume you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience visual and auditory hallucinations that force you to constantly question what is real and what is a glitch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/f7fb88f6d1ab752174526dd59e11977c.poster.avif?t=1787573376\" width=1020 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/f7fb88f6d1ab752174526dd59e11977c.webm?t=1787573376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/f7fb88f6d1ab752174526dd59e11977c.mp4?t=1787573376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choices Shape Your Reality</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no single path out of this digital trap. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Ending Paths:</strong> Your actions dictate how the final build resolves, leading to completely distinct narrative conclusions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/8a53bd7dbe9592dae0e008027806c235.poster.avif?t=1787573376\" width=1020 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/8a53bd7dbe9592dae0e008027806c235.webm?t=1787573376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/8a53bd7dbe9592dae0e008027806c235.mp4?t=1787573376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/a3c050a1782f6c30152a791a61483278.poster.avif?t=1787573376\" width=1020 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/a3c050a1782f6c30152a791a61483278.webm?t=1787573376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/a3c050a1782f6c30152a791a61483278.mp4?t=1787573376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You quit your job, moved back to your home country, and isolated yourself for one dream: becoming a game developer. But dreams demand sacrifice, Theo… more than you ever imagined. Your own creation has turned against you, and now it wants to end it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality Breach is an immersive, first-person psychological horror game set inside the claustrophobic walls of an indie developer's home studio. To survive the night, you must confront an entity born from your own corrupted project, where the line between your game engine and your physical room completely shatters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/96b66a25370dc514426790ce2b2d3ad5.poster.avif?t=1787573376\" width=1020 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/96b66a25370dc514426790ce2b2d3ad5.webm?t=1787573376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/96b66a25370dc514426790ce2b2d3ad5.mp4?t=1787573376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive Your Own Code</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It doesn’t like you, Theo. The entity born from your project hunts you in your own house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hide or Run:</strong> When the system breaches, find immediate cover or outmaneuver it to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/7d1c8e4bebba425d68fa2354de773358.poster.avif?t=1787573376\" width=1020 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/7d1c8e4bebba425d68fa2354de773358.webm?t=1787573376\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118910/extras/7d1c8e4bebba425d68fa2354de773358.mp4?t=1787573376\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Insanity or Reality?</strong></h2